Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Construct middleware under test directly instead of via
 AutoMock

Each test class now builds its middleware through the real constructor.
Mocks that tests set up or verify after construction (IHttpForwarder,
IRandomFactory, IHttpSysRequestDelegationFeature) become fields, so the
instance a test configures is the one the middleware received.

HttpSysDelegatorMiddleware takes the sealed HttpSysDelegator, which
AutoMock created as a real instance; the tests keep doing that.
